`cargo xtask spec-fields`: the usage, and its usage errors (exit 2). Without a
specifications checkout it cannot run, which is an error, never a pass.

```console
$ xtask spec-fields --help
usage: cargo xtask spec-fields [--specifications DIR] [--list]
...

$ xtask spec-fields --bogus
? 2
xtask spec-fields: unknown option `--bogus`
...

$ xtask spec-fields --specifications
? 2
xtask spec-fields: --specifications needs a directory
...

$ xtask spec-fields --specifications no-such-checkout
? 2
xtask spec-fields: no specifications checkout at no-such-checkout (set $OPENTIDE_SPECIFICATIONS_ROOT or pass --specifications)

```
